# Format and lint before returning

Before handing code changes back, run Prettier and the relevant linters
on every file you edited in that turn (not the full repository suite unless
asked). Fix any findings before reporting completion.

- Angular/web: `npx prettier --write <files>` then `npx ng lint` and
  `npx stylelint` for changed CSS.
- Markdown: `npx prettier --write <files>` when docs changed.
- C#: `dotnet format` on changed projects when C# changed.
